sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>RatingFormDialog
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UpdateRatingBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UpdateRatingController
  participant Rating as «entity»<br/>Rating
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: edit my rating
  UI->>B: PUT /api/customer/ratings/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: update(Integer customerId, Integer ratingId, RatingUpdateRequest request)
  alt rating not written by caller
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Rating: findById()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C->>Rating: update()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C-->>B: RatingResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end